    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 758.4pt; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 164.05pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"219\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Primary immunodeficiency disorder</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.8pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Genetic defect(s) (inheritance)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Typical clinical features (other than LPDs)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Approximate frequency of LPD and age range of LPD presentation</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.55pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Typical LPDs<sup>a</sup></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.8pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Key references</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 758.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"1011\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>DNA repair disorders</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 142.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"190\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Ataxia telangiectasia</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>ATM</em> (AR)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Cerebellar ataxia, oculocutaneous telangiectasia, variable CID, lung infections, malignancy (including carcinoma)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Neoplastic: 15&ndash;20%, 3&ndash;30&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">DLBCL (EBV+/&minus;), CHL (EBV+), BL, T-ALL, T-PLL (young adults)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{21792198; 25488969}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 142.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"190\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Nijmegen breakage syndrome</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>NBN</em> (formerly <em>NBS1</em>) (AR)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Microcephaly, dysmorphic facies, skeletal defects, ovarian insufficiency, intellectual deficit, variable CID</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Neoplastic: 40%, 2&ndash;25&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">DLBCL (EBV&minus;/+), T-ALL/LBL, CHL, PTCL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{18788073; 18937313; 26271390}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 142.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"190\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Bloom syndrome</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>BLM</em> (AR)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Short stature, dysmorphic facies, sun-sensitive erythema, hypogammaglobulinaemia, malignancy (including AML, carcinoma, Wilms tumour)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Neoplastic: 15%, 4&ndash;50&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">DLBCL, BL, B-ALL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{9062585; 30055079}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 736.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"6\" width=\"983\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Selected others<sup>a</sup>: LIG4 deficiency (DLBCL, T-ALL); DCLRE1C (ARTEMIS) deficiency (EBV+ lymphoma&nbsp;/ polymorphic LPD)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 758.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"1011\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Combined immunodeficiencies (other than DNA repair disorders)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 142.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"190\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Wiskott&ndash;Aldrich syndrome</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>WAS</em> (XL)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Microthrombocytopenia, eczema; recurrent bacterial and viral infections; autoimmune disease</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Neoplastic: 7&ndash;11%, 4&ndash;50&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">DLBCL (EBV+/&minus;), CHL, BL, polymorphic B-LPD (EBV+)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{3910193; 7996359; 30796981}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 142.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"190\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Cartilage hair hypoplasia</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>RMRP</em> (AR)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Metaphyseal chondrodysplasia, sparse hair, anaemia, Hirschsprung disease, basal cell carcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Neoplastic: 8%, 2&ndash;45&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">DLBCL (EBV+/&minus;)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{18698627}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 736.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"6\" width=\"983\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Selected others<sup>a</sup>: STK4 deficiency (EBV+ LPD); DOCK8 deficiency (EBV+ lymphoma); AD STAT3 deficiency&nbsp;/ AD-HIES (EBV&minus;/+ B/T-cell lymphoma); SCID<sup>b</sup> (EBV+ lymphoma&nbsp;/ polymorphic LPD)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 758.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"1011\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Predominantly antibody deficiencies</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 142.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"190\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Common variable immunodeficiency</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Multiple (including <em>NFKB1</em>, <em>IKZF1</em>), most unknown</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Recurrent sinopulmonary, ear, and GI infections; chronic lung disease; autoimmunity; enteropathy; granulomatous disease</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Non-neoplastic: 20&ndash;40%, 4&ndash;70&nbsp;years</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Neoplastic: 2&ndash;8%, 4&ndash;70&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lymphoid hyperplasia (LN, spleen, respiratory/GI mucosa), polymorphic B-LPD (EBV+/&minus;), EMZL, DLBCL (EBV&minus;/+), CHL, BL, others (especially adults), (B-ALL in <em>IKZF1</em> haploinsufficiency)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{18319398; 25749928; 29375540; 32117289; 32185577}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 142.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"190\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">APDS1/2</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">APDS1: <em>PIK3CD</em> GOF (AD)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">APDS2: <em>PIK3R1</em> (AD)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Recurrent sinopulmonary and ear infections, herpesvirus infections, autoimmunity, enteropathy, developmental delay</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Non-neoplastic: 75%, 1&ndash;40&nbsp;years</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Neoplastic: 15&ndash;25%, 2&ndash;60&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lymphoid hyperplasia (LN, spleen, respiratory/GI mucosa), DLBCL (EBV+/&minus;), CHL, NMZL, EMZL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{27221134; 27555459; 31942637}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 736.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"6\" width=\"983\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Selected others<sup>a</sup>: AICDA/UNG deficiency (lymphoid hyperplasia); <em>CARD11</em> GOF (polyclonal B-cell lymphocytosis)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 758.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"1011\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Diseases of immune dysregulation</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 142.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"190\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">X-linked lymphoproliferative disease&nbsp;1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>SH2D1A</em> (formerly <em>SAP</em>) (XL)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Dysgammaglobulinaemia, aplastic anaemia, vasculitis</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Non-neoplastic: 50%, 0&ndash;20&nbsp;years</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Neoplastic: 25%, 0&ndash;20&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">HLH/SIM (EBV+), HLH (EBV&minus;), BL, DLBCL (EBV+/&minus;), CHL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{3815312; 8559596; 20926771}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 142.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"190\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Other inborn errors of immunity associated with EBV susceptibility<sup>c</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>ITK</em><sup>d</sup>, <em>CD27</em>, <em>CD70</em>, <em>CTPS1</em>, <em>MAGT1</em>, <em>TNFRSF9</em>, <em>RASGRP1</em> (AR)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Chronic/recurrent/severe EBV infection, other viral and bacterial infections, variable CID, hypogammaglobulinaemia</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Non-neoplastic: 15&ndash;60%, 0&ndash;40&nbsp;years<sup>c</sup></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Neoplastic: 30&ndash;80%, 1&ndash;50&nbsp;years<sup>c</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lymphoid hyperplasia (LN, spleen) (EBV+/&minus;), SIM/HLH (EBV+), CHL, polymorphic B-LPD (EBV+), DLBCL (EBV+), BL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{25728094; 25843314; 31714901; 31942615; 32161190}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 142.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"190\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Autoimmune lymphoproliferative syndrome with <em>FAS</em> mutation</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>FAS</em> (formerly <em>TNFRSF6</em>) (most AD)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Autoimmune cytopenias, increased TCR&alpha;&beta;+ CD4&minus; CD8&minus; (DN) T&nbsp;cells</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Non-neoplastic: 100%, 0&ndash;35&nbsp;years</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Neoplastic: 8&ndash;11%, 5&ndash;60&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Characteristic lymphoid hyperplasia (LN, spleen), CHL, NLPHL, THRLBCL, BL, DLBCL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{11418480; 21885602; 24398331}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 142.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"190\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>CTLA4</em> haploinsufficiency</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>CTLA4</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Hypogammaglobulinaemia, autoimmune cytopenias, enteropathy/IBD, respiratory infection&nbsp;/ GLILD</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 97.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Non-neoplastic: 75%, 2&ndash;30&nbsp;years</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Neoplastic: 8%, 15&ndash;60&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lymphoid hyperplasia (LN, spleen), extranodal lymphocytic infiltrates (T&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;B), CHL, DLBCL (EBV&minus;), BL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{29729943; 30250467}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 736.9pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"6\" width=\"983\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Selected others<sup>a</sup>: PRF1 deficiency (HLH, lymphoma); <em>STAT3</em> GOF (non-neoplastic lymphoproliferation); IL10R1 and/or IL10R2 deficiency (DLBCL); XIAP deficiency (HLH); LRBA deficiency (lymphoid hyperplasia)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">AD, autosomal dominant; AML, acute myeloid leukaemia; APDS1/2, activated phosphoinositide 3-kinase delta syndrome&nbsp;1/2; AR, autosomal recessive; B-ALL, B-lymphoblastic leukaemia; BL, Burkitt lymphoma; B-LPD, B-cell lymphoproliferative disorder; CHL, classic Hodgkin lymphoma; CID, combined immunodeficiency; DLBCL, diffuse large B-cell lymphoma; DN, double-negative; EMZL, extranodal marginal zone lymphoma; GI, gastrointestinal; GLILD, granulomatous interstitial lung disease; GOF, gain of function; HIES, hyper-IgE syndrome; HLH, haemophagocytic lymphohistiocytosis; IBD, inflammatory bowel disease; LN, lymph nodes; NLPHL, nodular lymphocyte-predominant Hodgkin lymphoma; NMZL, nodal marginal zone lymphoma; PTCL, peripheral T-cell lymphoma; SCID, severe combined immunodeficiency; SIM, severe infectious mononucleosis; T-ALL, T-lymphoblastic leukaemia; T-LBL, T-lymphoblastic lymphoma; <a name=\"_Hlk102219079\"></a>THRLBCL, T-cell/histiocyte&ndash;rich large B-cell lymphoma; T-PLL, T-cell prolymphocytic leukaemia; XL, X-linked.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>a</sup>Other types of LPD have (less frequently) been reported in many of these primary immunodeficiencies. <sup>b</sup>LPD is rare in typical SCID but has been more frequently reported in patients with hypomorphic mutations (e.g. of <em>RAG1</em> and/or <em>RAG2</em>) and a milder clinical phenotype, or in patients with adenosine deaminase&ndash;deficient SCID who are taking enzyme replacement therapy.<sup> c</sup>These conditions have overlapping but distinct clinicopathological features, including variation in the frequencies of different associated LPDs and age at LPD presentation; in the age ranges given, most of the adult presentations are patients with <em>MAGT1</em> deficiency.<sup> d</sup><em>ITK</em> deficiency is classified as a CID by the International Union of Immunological Societies (IUIS) Expert Committee <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{31953710}</span>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Additional key references: <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{27515251; 26732628; 31057537; 31580160}</span>.</p>",
